Feature: Static pages
  As a visitor
  I want pages that need no scripts to arrive as plain HTML
  So that they load fast and work everywhere

  Scenario: A page without a client directive or router ships no JavaScript
    Given I am on "/static/"
    Then the page should be generated by Astro
    And the page should not ship JavaScript
    And the page should not have any islands

  Scenario: A page with islands ships JavaScript
    Given I am on "/islands/"
    Then the page should ship JavaScript
